sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant Nav as Native navigation
 participant Chat as Shared ConversationId
 participant Help as Local Help and tool registry
 participant View as Home or sidebar view
 participant Agent as Workspace coordinator
 User->>Nav: Navigate while sidebar is open
 Nav->>Chat: Append host notice; preserve prior entries
 Chat-->>View: Render latest notice; retain ordinary messages
 Nav->>Help: Resolve screen topic and capability references
 User->>View: Open sidebar: capture current screen
 View->>Chat: Append current screen; reuse shared session
 Note over Nav,Agent: Closed sidebar: no notices or replay; navigation does not request inference
 User->>View: Send message
 View->>Chat: Append user event
 Chat->>Agent: Routed turn with current screen context
 Agent->>Help: Read local topic and effective tool metadata
 Agent-->>Chat: Linked answer or permitted operation
 User->>Nav: Return Home
 Nav->>View: Close sidebar and show same Home conversation
